From: mscharged-port
Subject: [PATCH] Declare native interrupt APIs in original auxiliary reverb
Upstream-base: 5f9047649dd6cfcf1a3268cf79be2e3d58d9a6c3

Modern C requires the declarations for the original interrupt calls. Native
mem.h no longer supplies the console's transitive OS include. Include the
canonical SDK facade explicitly without changing any reverb method or request.
The original console preprocessing remains unchanged.

diff --git a/src/RVL_SDK/axfx/AXFXReverbHiExpDpl2.c b/src/RVL_SDK/axfx/AXFXReverbHiExpDpl2.c
--- a/src/RVL_SDK/axfx/AXFXReverbHiExpDpl2.c
+++ b/src/RVL_SDK/axfx/AXFXReverbHiExpDpl2.c
@@ -1,6 +1,9 @@
 #include <revolution/ax.h>
 #include <revolution/axfx.h>
 #include <revolution/mem.h>
+#ifdef MSCHARGED_NATIVE
+#include <revolution/os.h>
+#endif
 
 #include <math.h>
 
